 "summary": "NPN silicon transistors for high collector voltages, in the three-lead SOT-23 (TO-236) surface-mount package. The MMBTA42L and SMMBTA42L take 300 V collector to emitter and collector to base; the MMBTA43L takes 200 V. Collector current is 500 mA continuous, and dissipation is 225 mW on an FR-5 board or 300 mW on an alumina substrate at 25 °C. The S-prefix parts are AEC-Q101 qualified and PPAP capable, for automotive and other uses that need unique site and change control. Every version is lead-free, RoHS compliant and free of halogens and BFRs.",
